ut":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Swamp","oracle_id":"56719f6a-1a6c-4c0a-8d21-18f7d7350b68","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {B}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["B"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Swamp"},{"cmc":3.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}","name":"The Mana Rig","oracle_id":"58678469-77e5-4c1b-88d6-5e6642b0c8ca","oracle_text":"Whenever you cast a multicolored spell, create a tapped Powerstone token. (It's an artifact with \"{T}: Add {C}. This mana can't be spent to cast a nonartifact spell.\")\n{X}{X}{X}, {T}: Look at the top X cards of your library. Put up to two of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.","power":null,"produced_mana":["C"],"released_at":"2022-09-09","toughness":null,"type_line":"Legendary Artifact"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["G","U"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Tropical Island","oracle_id":"74b7fe23-5d3a-4092-8d78-7c0eba8f6f73","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["G","U"],"released_at":"2014-06-16","toughness":null,"type_line":"Land — Forest Island"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Although all the cards in the Dominaria United set that create Powerstone tokens create a tapped Powerstone token, entering the battlefield tapped isn’t part of the token’s definition. Notably, if you create a token that is a copy of a Powerstone token, the token copy won’t enter the battlefield tapped.","oracle_id":"58678469-77e5-4c1b-88d6-5e6642b0c8ca","published_at":"2022-09-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Powerstone tokens are a new kind of predefined token. Each one has the artifact subtype “Powerstone” and the ability “{T}: Add {C}. This mana can’t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell.”","oracle_id":"58678469-77e5-4c1b-88d6-5e6642b0c8ca","published_at":"2022-09-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can use the {C} added by a Powerstone token on anything that isn’t a nonartifact spell. This includes paying costs to activate abilities of both artifact and nonartifact permanents, paying ward costs, and so on.","oracle_id":"58678469-77e5-4c1b-88d6-5e6642b0c8ca","published_at":"2022-09-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Domain abilities count the number of basic land types among lands you control, not how many lands you control or how many of any type.","oracle_id":"620f3851-493d-496e-880a-4a9dee074e79","published_at":"2022-09-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don’t contribute to domain abilities.","oracle_id":"620f3851-493d-496e-880a-4a9dee074e79","published_at":"2022-09-09","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This has basic land types, but it isn't a basic land. Things that affect basic lands don't affect it. Things that affect basic land types do.","oracle_id":"74b7fe23-5d3a-4092-8d78-7c0eba8f6f73","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This has the mana abilities associated with both of its basic land types.","oracle_id":"74b7fe23-5d3a-4092-8d78-7c0eba8f6f73","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the chosen target is illegal when Lightning Helix tries to resolve, it won't resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won't gain 3 life.","oracle_id":"800c258a-cfc4-4a54-a667-065ea8dea69e","published_at":"2017-11-17","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the chosen target is illegal when Lightning Helix tries to resolve, it won't resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won't gain 3 life.","oracle_id":"800c258a-cfc4-4a54-a667-065ea8dea69e","published_at":"2024-02-02","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
